  "question": {
    "text": "The line <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is rotated through an angle <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> in the clockwise direction about the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> The equation of the line in its new position is"
  },
